section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小安運動會時跑最後一名，在參賽選手中表現「首屈一指」","n":26,"ssz":".......................2.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文中說「遮光能催花，但只能提早5到7天，對農民沒有太大幫助」，主要原因是什麼？","n":39,"ssz":"......................................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"遮光只能小幅提早，仍難把開花時間提前到過年","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"遮光會減少光照，花朵品質容易明顯變差","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"遮光需要整片花房覆蓋，材料與人力成本太高","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"遮光會影響生長節奏，導致花梗抽得不整齊","n":19,"ssz":"......1........1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據文中最後幾段，花農把蘭花送上高海拔、或利用海邊冷源降溫。這兩種做法最共同的特色是什麼？","n":45,"ssz":"............................................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"都是改用自然條件降溫，減少大量開冷氣的成本","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"都是把蘭花換到不同地點，讓花期自然提前一段時間","n":23,"ssz":"...................1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"都是利用環境刺激讓花梗冒出，縮短開花準備期","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"都是用新設備提供冷風，讓花房溫度下降更快更穩","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"本文主要想說明什麼？","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只要調整白天光照長短，就能讓蝴蝶蘭提早開花","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"提高磷鉀肥比例，可讓蝴蝶蘭花團